#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:5
#: d9f5e6fe8dec473a8d1d0b8a47bf50ea
msgid "Porting to a new flight controller board"
msgstr "移植到新的飞行控制器板"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:7
#: a112e78047b14ac193427fefaa516474
msgid ""
"This section is for topics related to running ArduPilot directly on Linux "
"boards. See this :ref:`page for porting to boards running ChibiOS "
"<porting>`."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍直接在 Linux 飞控板上运行 ArduPilot 的相关主题。有关移植到运行 ChibiOS 的飞控板，请参见 :ref:`此页面 "
"<porting>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:10
#: 0a92d942305748fba7dfaa34f7de20bd
msgid ""
"Any firmware customization of ArduPilot code must abide by the terms of the "
"GPL3.0+ open source code license. ArduPilot also reminds developers and "
"manufacturers to adhere to the appropriate trademark and copyright laws when"
" developing new autopilots"
msgstr ""
"对 ArduPilot 代码的任何固件定制都必须遵守 GPL3.0+ 开源代码许可证条款。ArduPilot "
"也提醒开发者和制造商在开发新飞控时遵守相关商标和版权法律。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:15
#: fa28bb8074ea424cb9b0cdf11b7a90b7
msgid ""
"Consider joining the `ArduPilot Discord Chat "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__, to speak with other developers about "
"this topic under the HAL-DEV, #Linux channel."
msgstr ""
"欢迎加入 `ArduPilot Discord 聊天 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__，在 HAL-DEV 的 "
"#Linux 频道与其他开发者就此主题交流。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:18
#: 65efb6e0b03543c382efedff5bc26c6b
msgid "Step 1 - getting started"
msgstr "第 1 步 - 入门准备"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:20
#: 4cc8ff4368c74b82bc620409f292a3b9
msgid ""
"Determine which microprocessor the new flight controllers uses. If it is "
"used in a board we already support, for example BCM283x used in Raspberry Pi"
" or TI Sitara/OMAP used in BeagleBones, then the port should be relatively "
"straight forward."
msgstr ""
"确定新飞控所使用的微处理器。如果该处理器已用于我们支持的飞控板（例如 Raspberry Pi 使用的 BCM283x 或 BeagleBone 使用的"
" TI Sitara/OMAP），则移植工作应相对简单。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:21
#: 7fc616ffde9b45f69910180cd056c9a2
msgid "Choose a new board name."
msgstr "选择新飞控板的名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:22
#: da40213646a144faa8a8331739759f46
msgid ""
"Reserve a new HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE_LINUX_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME) in "
"libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h"
msgstr ""
"在 libraries/AP_HAL/AP_HAL_Boards.h 中保留新的 "
"HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE_LINUX_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME)"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:23
#: a9d1279e55ff430a842d4477a6c2d133
msgid ""
"Ensure the spidev and i2cdev kernel modules are built if ArduPilot will be "
"using them."
msgstr "如果 ArduPilot 将使用 spidev 和 i2cdev 内核模块，请确保它们已构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:25
#: cf77fca190314b0e852c30e79638d838
msgid ""
"Choose your board name carefully! Use 13 characters or less for your board "
"name, otherwise it may be truncated when the board name is sent from the "
"flight controller to a ground station such as Mission Planner."
msgstr "请谨慎选择飞控板名称！飞控板名称请使用 13 个字符以内，否则飞控向 Mission Planner 等地面站发送飞控板名称时可能被截断。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:28
#: ec2f308287f44498bab98d3a6622fd56
msgid "Step 2 - Toolchain Configuration"
msgstr "第 2 步 - 工具链配置"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:30
#: 810f684c8c5b4bb686f81282ca9d7e72
msgid "In Tools/ardupilotwaf/boards.py:"
msgstr "在 Tools/ardupilotwaf/boards.py 中："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:32
#: bf9d8056b16c4c1f945aa2b42695ee49
msgid ""
"Create a new class and select the appropriate toolchain, usually arm-linux-"
"gnueabihf. For an example see \"class pxfmini(linux) as an example\""
msgstr ""
"创建新类并选择合适的工具链，通常为 arm-linux-gnueabihf。参见 「class pxfmini(linux) as an "
"example」 示例"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:33
#: a0dd80dee59c4082b89513c93badb610
msgid "Update CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE with the newly reserved board subtype."
msgstr "将 CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE 更新为新保留的飞控板子类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:35
#: bc97a594f0c34923a36bdf9fa75e3730
msgid "In Tools/scripts/board_list.py:"
msgstr "在 Tools/scripts/board_list.py 中："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:37
#: 282839f29fa5424f9920604cb1f2f3cc
msgid "Add new board name to self.boards[] list."
msgstr "将新飞控板名称添加到 self.boards[] 列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:40
#: 0948de9ce347436b9ab8af85a7d56a0a
msgid "Step 3 - configure and build examples and firmware for the board"
msgstr "第 3 步 - 配置并构建飞控板的示例和固件"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:42
#: 7693fced8763414fb3d77766b163c828
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`Building the code <building-the-code>` instructions or take"
" a shortcut and read the `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ file which "
"includes doing the following:"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`构建代码 <building-the-code>` 说明操作，或快捷地阅读 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ "
"文件，其中包括以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:44
#: 0ccb169c1cbb44ff8184a52674b4b181
msgid ""
"``cd ardupilot`` (or wherever you have :ref:`cloned <git-clone>` ArduPilot "
"to)"
msgstr "``cd ardupilot`` （或您 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` ArduPilot 的目录）"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:45
#: 8cae54364d474216ae6ab20c8d3ff008
msgid "``./waf configure --board new-board``"
msgstr "``./waf configure --board new-board``"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:46
#: 19968a73875a4ea18d328e88efe9df4e
msgid "``./waf copter``"
msgstr "``./waf copter``"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:48
#: 5850207dccaa4b92a3ed375694399ee9
msgid ""
"Work through any issues highlighted by '#error' messages in the codebase, "
"which will require per-board configuration."
msgstr "处理代码库中 '#error' 消息突出显示的任何问题，这些问题需要进行飞控板专属配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:50
#: 10d0653c081e4549b2ac36792ef98dd2
msgid ""
"This is also a good time to build any relevant :ref:`Library Example "
"Sketches <learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches>`."
msgstr ""
"这也是构建相关 :ref:`库示例 Sketch <learning-ardupilot-the-example-sketches>` 的好时机。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:53
#: 27f7c5d0f80548b5b9c0d6b3d6840bfa
msgid "Step 4 - upload and run the examples and firmware"
msgstr "第 4 步 - 上传并运行示例和固件"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:55
#: 53a63c2922fd454197ddd46e93cdfa77
msgid ""
"If building natively, executables are already loaded on the target system, "
"and can be executed directly."
msgstr "如果是本地构建，可执行文件已在目标系统上加载，可直接执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:57
#: dabd7bc12b024c02b2c9bbbe6cac1c5c
msgid ""
"If using waf to upload (Linux, MacOSX only), see configuration commands in "
"`BUILD.md <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ "
"to set up waf's --upload flag. Other options for cross-compiled builds "
"include SCP or NFS."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 waf 上传（仅限 Linux、MacOSX），请参见 `BUILD.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/BUILD.md>`__ 中的配置命令以设置 "
"waf 的 --upload 标志。交叉编译构建的其他选项包括 SCP 或 NFS。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:60
#: 266fd1adbdbe434aac0b3357cbed4d05
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Startup options <ardupilot-on-linux-starting>` for command-line "
"options, configuring at least one port for MavLink, and launching ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"请参见 :ref:`启动选项 <ardupilot-on-linux-starting>`，了解命令行选项、为 MAVLink 配置至少一个端口以及启动"
" ArduPilot 的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:63
#: c7a56b1bb5ec4595a377b8edcb637e40
msgid "Step 5 - peripheral functions and drivers"
msgstr "第 5 步 - 外设功能与驱动"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:65
#: bbd9ca7aebe248e696e41f021c871c93
msgid ""
"Many boards will use the Linux userspace APIs for I2C, UART, and SPI and "
"only need configuration and associated kernel modules. See your CPU, BSP, "
"and board's documentation for pin muxing and device tree configuration. The "
"following peripherals tend to be more complicated."
msgstr ""
"许多飞控板将使用 Linux 用户空间 API 进行 I2C、UART 和 SPI 通信，只需配置和相关内核模块。有关引脚复用和设备树配置，请参阅 "
"CPU、BSP 和飞控板文档。以下外设通常较为复杂。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:69
#: 167ea6328a49486089da4329108817b2
msgid "SPI Support"
msgstr "SPI 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:70
#: 0c39e4fd066841ceb6397a49d57cf5a0
msgid ""
"To configure SPI-based devices, the Linux userspace SPI APIs are used, "
"needing only the per-board configuration(bus ID, chip select ID, mode, "
"rates) in SPIDeviceManager::_device[] in "
"libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/SPIDevice.cpp."
msgstr ""
"配置基于 SPI 的设备时，使用 Linux 用户空间 SPI API，只需在 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/SPIDevice.cpp"
" 的 SPIDeviceManager::_device[] 中进行飞控板专属配置（总线 ID、片选 ID、模式、速率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:73
#: 62851a07391e46f291b2608e3ebd3a80
msgid "GPIO Support"
msgstr "GPIO 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:74
#: 998b541080b24e56be3a58bc90555ecc
msgid ""
"Most ArduPilot Linux boards use one of two methods for GPIO access: sysfs or"
" mmap."
msgstr "大多数 ArduPilot Linux 飞控板使用两种 GPIO 访问方式之一：sysfs 或 mmap。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:76
#: a8b1fe639ece4d0983d4a8ad0224e1bf
msgid "For sysfs:"
msgstr "对于 sysfs："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:78
#: 09a06315fe88482993ec29c7f1d05312
msgid "GPIO access through sysfs is deprecated."
msgstr "通过 sysfs 进行 GPIO 访问已弃用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:79
#: 6b7c3a419b4c4aafb5361cd3ea2cd83f
msgid ""
"Create new libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME).cpp and .h, filled "
"out with the needed _$(NEW_BOARD_NAME)_GPIO_MAX and pin_table."
msgstr ""
"创建新的 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME).cpp 和 .h，填写所需的 "
"_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME)_GPIO_MAX 和 pin_table。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:81
#: 4bc82e84c4b84974a3835fc825af95e8
msgid "For libgpiod(Todo):"
msgstr "对于 libgpiod（待办）："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:83
#: 5fcc14eb41d24bafb8202ee006b7b05a
msgid ""
"port ardupilot to support a libgpiod backend of pinMode(), read(), write()."
msgstr "移植 ArduPilot 以支持 libgpiod 作为 pinMode()、read()、write() 的后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:84
#: 77051dad6c7b4b8e98087848b898a5c0
msgid "Implement the per-board configuration"
msgstr "实现飞控板专属配置"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:86
#: f4da239c88344c95b6b9503497793b9b
msgid "For mmap():"
msgstr "对于 mmap()："

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:88
#: 26edbd90850945eeb7b50060897ca431
msgid "See GPIO_BBB.cpp and GPIO_RPI.cpp as examples"
msgstr "参见 GPIO_BBB.cpp 和 GPIO_RPI.cpp 作为示例"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:89
#: 9fdc2d9b3f864158acfa7a31abf9ccf7
msgid "Create new libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME).cpp and .h"
msgstr "创建新的 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME).cpp 和 .h"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:90
#: 686696888e964a73b7e871f810ae2457
msgid ""
"Locate the memory file, either /dev/mem or /dev/gpiomem, and open() it."
msgstr "找到内存文件（/dev/mem 或 /dev/gpiomem）并执行 open()。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:91
#: e193515f3bb34063b4ada2b5a598e929
msgid ""
"Locate the offset of the GPIO memory region in the file. If using /dev/mem, "
"check the processor reference manual or Linux device-tree files. For "
"/dev/gpiomem, use zero."
msgstr ""
"找到文件中 GPIO 内存区域的偏移量。若使用 /dev/mem，请查阅处理器参考手册或 Linux 设备树文件。对于 "
"/dev/gpiomem，使用零。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:92
#: f2c811b7b4834870b5e39b40c13ad553
msgid "mmap() the GPIO registers into ArduPilot using the above offset."
msgstr "使用上述偏移量通过 mmap() 将 GPIO 寄存器映射到 ArduPilot 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:93
#: 2503b750c55c4f69951034b94f471dbf
msgid ""
"Implement pinMode(), read(), write() functions using the memory mapped GPIO "
"registers."
msgstr "使用内存映射的 GPIO 寄存器实现 pinMode()、read()、write() 函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:95
#: 8e9ad54146f045eb94d5a6287c6053ea
msgid ""
"CPUs with multiple GPIOs per bank with only a DATA or OUT register without "
"SET and CLEAR registers may need to avoid the mmap backend, as read-modify-"
"write accesses to a GPIO DATA register may not be threadsafe when the kernel"
" or other userspace programs use GPIOs in the same bank."
msgstr ""
"每个 bank 有多个 GPIO、只有 DATA 或 OUT 寄存器而没有 SET 和 CLEAR 寄存器的 CPU，可能需要避免使用 mmap "
"后端，因为当内核或其他用户空间程序使用同一 bank 中的 GPIO 时，对 GPIO DATA 寄存器的读-改-写访问可能不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:97
#: 25cdff580bbc4daba32dce50fa4623e3
msgid ""
"For either approach, edit libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO.h to include the "
"appropriate GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME) header for the board."
msgstr ""
"无论采用哪种方式，都需编辑 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/GPIO.h，为该开发板包含相应的 "
"GPIO_$(NEW_BOARD_NAME) 头文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:100
#: b1d1b996c7524f2e8fde3be51ef9d611
msgid "RCInput"
msgstr "RCInput"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:101
#: f053769b61f749fba39391cfb24ac154
msgid ""
"Several different RCInput mechanisms are supported by different boards, "
"including PPM, SBUS, UART, and UDP."
msgstr "不同开发板支持多种 RCInput 机制，包括 PPM、SBUS、UART 和 UDP。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:103
#: 774dfac2eaa8473e87e1dcac2f2f4088
msgid ""
"PPM input is handled per-CPU, usually with either a DMA or utility "
"microcontroller like the PRU on TI chips."
msgstr "PPM 输入按 CPU 处理，通常使用 DMA 或辅助微控制器（如 TI 芯片上的 PRU）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:105
#: 068803e8d5034b9382c1fffb53b40bfc
msgid ""
"Examine the libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/RCInput_* files to see if a suitable one "
"exists, or create one."
msgstr "查看 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/RCInput_* 文件，确认是否存在合适的实现，或自行创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:107
#: ec28949641574caea9fc7cf3a3ce7ea3
msgid ""
"Configure rcinDriver in libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/HAL_Linux_Class.cpp using "
"CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE."
msgstr ""
"使用 CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE 在 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/HAL_Linux_Class.cpp 中配置"
" rcinDriver。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:110
#: 625a8d7c0c4d43e8952ca76880c98170
msgid "RCOutput"
msgstr "RCOutput"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:111
#: 23eb43623a844add8a694d360b0ee4ab
msgid ""
"Similar to RCInput, examine the libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/RCOutput_* files to "
"see if a suitable one exists, or create one."
msgstr ""
"与 RCInput 类似，查看 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/RCOutput_* 文件，确认是否存在合适的实现，或自行创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:113
#: 70944f67f15c4162a1b7686190826362
msgid ""
"For CPUs without corresponding hardware to generate RCOutput signals, "
"additional hardware may be used, like NXP's PCA9685 for PWM generation."
msgstr "对于没有对应硬件来生成 RCOutput 信号的 CPU，可使用额外硬件，例如 NXP 的 PCA9685 来生成 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:115
#: 1d987eb96c5a4ad2ac4c9b77d30c9ff8
msgid ""
"Configure the rcoutDriver in libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/HAL_Linux_Class.cpp "
"using CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE."
msgstr ""
"使用 CONFIG_HAL_BOARD_SUBTYPE 在 libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/HAL_Linux_Class.cpp 中配置"
" rcoutDriver。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:118
#: e52db517e92e41d481408c65f88d855e
msgid "Step 7 - bring up the sensors"
msgstr "第 7 步——启动传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:120
#: aa9fb4edea814e7cb3093ab180d99274
msgid "Add sensor related configuration to libraries/AP_HAL/board/linux.h."
msgstr "将传感器相关配置添加到 libraries/AP_HAL/board/linux.h。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:122
#: bf3d902236234bdfa08ae13da46c099b
msgid ""
"Start with the baro first, then IMU, then compass and finally any other "
"sensors the default sensor orientation should also be filled in along with "
"other things."
msgstr "先从气压计开始，然后是 IMU，接着是罗盘，最后是其他任何传感器，同时应填写默认传感器方向等信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:125
#: f2ecf4ecefbe4513b16a6bf16681c9cd
msgid "Upload the examples and firmware and test the sensors are working."
msgstr "上传示例程序和固件，测试传感器是否正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:128
#: ec4e2ffa328743febcaff9e633de3d82
msgid "Step 8 - configure parameter, log, and terrain storage"
msgstr "第 8 步——配置参数、日志和地形存储"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:130
#: 26065b190dfd40dd8c1a3c0eda516bbd
msgid ""
"Configure HAL_BOARD_LOG_DIRECTORY, HAL_BOARD_TERRAIN_DIRECTORY, "
"HAL_BOARD_STORAGE_DIRECTORY in libraries/AP_HAL/board/linux.h."
msgstr ""
"在 libraries/AP_HAL/board/linux.h 中配置 "
"HAL_BOARD_LOG_DIRECTORY、HAL_BOARD_TERRAIN_DIRECTORY、HAL_BOARD_STORAGE_DIRECTORY。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:133
#: 99f96ead653944369acbc12cc6b1c728
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-porting.rst:135
#: 4cd0bda741164749840a157317229e4e
msgid ""
"If you have gotten this far, congratulations you have ported ArduPilot to a "
"new board!  Please reach out to the other developers on the `ArduPilot "
